# The published list of the retentions of the tables an entry's reading leaves for its next reading (TableRetentionOption): kept_all, every table, never dropped; none_kept, none, each reading from no table; dropped_at_percent, every table until they reach its one field, an integer from 1 to 100, percent of the table limit, then none.
# A Scott sum whose constructors are the tuple's fields, in the order of the
# enum's cases; an entry.lambdalattice imports this file and writes a
# constructor, and EntryData reads which alternative it takes by structure
# (gezi.contest.entry.EntryData, THE OPTIONS AS SCOTT CONSTRUCTORS).
λ export
. (λtuple. tuple λkept_all none_kept dropped_at_percent. kept_all)
λ kept_all
. (λtuple. tuple λkept_all none_kept dropped_at_percent. none_kept)
λ none_kept
. (λtuple. tuple λpercent kept_all none_kept dropped_at_percent. dropped_at_percent percent)
λ dropped_at_percent
. export kept_all none_kept dropped_at_percent
